  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1283A"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is41">
        <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e98">Caput 41</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_1@1-4">Taceant insulae.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is41-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is41-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e113">Quia in salo gentes, scilicet quae salsis et amaris fluctibus saeculi tunduntur.I</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e117">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e119">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e121">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e123" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_2@1-4">Quis suscitavit ab oriente.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is41-Rd1e126"><name xml:id="gom-is41-Nd1e127" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e130"><seg type="qs">Quidam Hebraeorum hoc ad Cyrum regem Persarum referunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui ab initio cognovit haec.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e139">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e141">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e143">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e145" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_3@6-8">Semita in pedibus.</quote>
            Laborem vel lassitudinem ejus vitae non sentiet: <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e148" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps18_6@15-20">Exsultavit ut gigas ad currendam viam.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e153">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e155">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e157">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e159" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_5@1-2">Viderunt insulae.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is41-Rd1e162"><name xml:id="gom-is41-Nd1e163" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e166"><seg type="qs">Id est gentes in <pb ed="#P" n="1283B"/> circumitu</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et confortavit eum clavis praeceptorum, ut in timore Domini permaneret.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e178">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e180">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e182">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e184" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_8@1-5">Et tu, Israel, serve meus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is41-Rd1e187"><name xml:id="gom-is41-Nd1e188" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e191"><seg type="qs">Dominus ad apostolos affectuose</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">postea electi in amicitiam Dei jungimur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e200">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e202">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e204">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e206" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_9@8-10">Et a longinquis.</quote>
            Jam usque ad extrema Judaei dispersi, et inde ad finem multi vocati.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e211">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e213">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e215">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e217" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_14@3-4">Vermis Jacob.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is41-Rd1e220"><name xml:id="gom-is41-Nd1e221" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e224">Vermes dicuntur apostoli, tanquam ejus imitatores qui dicit: <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e226" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps21_7@1-7">Ego sum vermis et non homo</quote>. Et sicut vermis penetrat terram, sic praedicatio eorum corda audientium.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e231">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e233" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_14@5-9">Qui mortui estis ex Israel.</quote>
            Sicut ille qui dicit: <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e236" source="http://scta.info/resource/Icor15_31@1-6">Quotidie morior propter vestram gloriam, fratres</quote>; et alibi: <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e239" source="http://scta.info/resource/gal2_20@1-10">Vivo autem jam non ego; vivit <pb ed="#P" n="1283C"/> vero in me Christus</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e246">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e248">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e250">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e252" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_15@1-5">Ego posui te quasi plaustrum.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e255"><seg type="qs">Vir ecclesiasticus habet praedicationis rostra</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut male congregati bene dividantur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e264">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e266">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e268">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e270" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_19@1-4">Dabo in solitudinem cedrum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is41-Rd1e273"><name xml:id="gom-is41-Nd1e274" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e277">Arborum varietates diversitatem spiritualis gratiae significant, ne saltem una chorda de cithara Domini, et aliqua virtus gratiarum Ecclesiae deesse videatur: quarum sublimitatem ad coelestia festinantem illuminat lignum olivae, fomes lucis, requies laborantis vel lassati.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e280">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e282" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_19@6-11">Spinam, et myrtum, et lignum olivae.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e285"><seg type="qs">LXX: <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e288">Sethim,</quote> quae est arbor albae spinae similis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et ideo consolatores sanctae Ecclesiae significat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e296">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e298">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e300">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e302" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_22@11-11">Annuntiate.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is41-Rd1e305"><name xml:id="gom-is41-Nd1e306" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e309"><seg type="qs">Significat quia <pb ed="#P" n="1283D"/> idola nec audiendi nec respondendi habent facultatem</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">patet quod idola post adventum Christi vocem amiserunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e321">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e323">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e325">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e327" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_23@17-18">Si potestis.</quote>
            Neque daemones possunt, nisi Dei permissione, quod assident idolis, quia nec porcos, nec sancti Job jumenta potuerunt disperdere sine Dei permissione. Paulus quoque tradidit Satanae quosdam.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e332">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e334">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e336">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e338" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_25@1-1">Suscitavi.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is41-Rd1e341"><name xml:id="gom-is41-Nd1e342" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e345"><seg type="qs">Adhuc contra idola loquitur et contra cultores eorum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut credant in eum qui venit ab ortu solis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e354">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e356">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e358">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e360" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_26@1-4">Quis annuntiavit ab exordio?</quote>
            quasi diceret: Nullus in gentibus fuit qui annuntiaverit adventum Filii. Si est autem qui annuntiaverit, dicemus, <pb ed="#P" n="1284A"/> quia justus est; in adventu Filii, daemones, qui in idolis ventura nuntiabant, obmutuerant.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e366">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e368" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_26@21-23">Audiens sermones vestros.</quote>
            Quia bruta gentilium corda errorem suum intellexerunt, et vaticinia falsa reliquerunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e373">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e375">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e377">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e379" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_27@1-4">Primus ad Sion dicet.</quote>
            Ecclesiam significant; ecce astiterunt filii, scilicet tui, quos per fidem meam donavi tibi, scilicet apostoli, quorum praedicatione nati sunt tibi filii.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is41-Dd1e384">
          <head xml:id="gom-is41-Hd1e386">Versus 29</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is41-d1e388">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is41-Qd1e390" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_29@1-3">Ecce omnes injusti.</quote>
            Quidquid de idolis vel de gentibus diximus, ad haeresiarchas et pravitatis dogmata referamus, quia, Christo pacem Ecclesiae nuntiante et veritatem monstrante, ipsi errores sequuntur, et vento et turbini comparantur.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
